%
% This is file `ufrj.ins'.
%
% It uses the docstrip utility to generate, from file `ufrj.dtx', the `ufrj'
% document class, its biblatex styles and language packs, the makeindex style,
% the bibliographic databases, the English quick reference and the latexmkrc.
% The unit styles, and the example documents that use them, come from their
% own files: `ufrj-coppe.ins' generates the COPPE one.
%
% Copyright (C) 2008-2026 Vicente Helano F. Batista, George O. Ainsworth Jr.,
%                         Geraldo Xexéo and Eduardo Mangeli.
% CoppeTeX 5.0.
